.TH "nvme_init_set_features_power_limit" 9 "nvme_init_set_features_power_limit" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_set_features_power_limit \- Initialize passthru command for Power Limit
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_set_features_power_limit
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool sv "  ","
.BI "__u8 pls "  ","
.BI "__u16 plv "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sv" 12
Save value across power states
.IP "pls" 12
Power Limit Scale (PLS)
.IP "plv" 12
Power Limit Value (PLV)
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Set Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_POWER_LIMIT
